{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-sublime","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Sublime","description":"\u003cp\u003eSublime S:ALT by Riot Squad - Sub-Lime is a citrus blend featuring berry fruit notes. A combination of zesty lemon and sharp lime is fused with a bitter blackcurrant, for an e-liquid which plays between sweet and sour notes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41880991957047,"sku":"Riot - Sublime - 20 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41880991989815,"sku":"Riot - Sublime - 48 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Sub-Lime-Hybrid-by-Riot-Squad-Salts.webp?v=1758180621","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-sublime","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




